==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* [[Drayden]] announces that the {{un|Pokémon League}}'s date has been moved up.
* {{adv|Black}} defeats [[Brycen]].
* Black goes to [[Mistralton Cave]] where he encounters the [[Swords of Justice]].
* [[N]] challenges [[Alder]] to a battle, and is revealed to have tamed {{p|Zekrom}}.
* {{p|Reshiram}} appears from inside the [[Light Stone]], but reverts back.
* N defeats Alder.
* {{adv|White}} tells [[Gigi]] that she is free to do what she wants to.
* [[Musha]] leaves Black.
* The third [[Pokédex]] meant for {{adv|Cheren}} is destroyed by N.

